              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo AMBUJE ŵasalalile mtima ni kwatendela canasa Aisalaeliwo. Ŵatendele canasa jemanjajo ligongo lya cilanga",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ciŵapangene ni Abulahamu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Isaki, ni Yakobo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Myoyo AMBUJE nginasaka kuti amagongo ŵajonanje jemanjaji. Soni nganiŵaliŵalila ŵandu ŵakwewo mpaka lelo jino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali awile Hasaele mwenye jwa ku Siliya, Beni Hadadi mwanagwe ŵajinjile m'malo mwakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowashi, mwenye jwa ku Isalaeli, ŵamenyene ngondo ni asilikali ŵa ku Siliya, nipo ŵapundile kwakwana katatu. Ŵamsumwile Beni Hadadi misinda josope jiŵasumwile Hasaele pa ngondo jiŵamenyanaga ni Yehowahasi babagwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
